# Names only. The real file is /etc/forever-market-feed/api.env on the server (owner fmf-deploy, mode 0600).
# The bearer token the PC sends; the PC puts the same value into its .env.market-feed (openssl rand -hex 32).
# The API's database password (read-only role feed_api) is generated into api-database.env when provisioning.
FEED_API_TOKEN=
